      "author": "Prof. Sulekh Kumar",
      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "<p>If you change your mindset, you have the ability to change your whole world. The most important thing is our mindset because our thought is responsible for creation of our future. The idea of our mind is so much creative so that we should be successful at any cost. Our thought is irrigated with toil and blood. Our thought is so powerful that it is sufficient to achieve anything in the world. As you think, you will be. It means that everything in this world is controlled by our thought only. So, we must be positive at any cost because our positivity is only one strong power to succeed in life.to fight with&nbsp;</p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj94fqHUnH9pDZHRMapEo43qs7yqCQMHVmRQOOYECAHsmLuRAOi1T3xygQfbpbjxVjz6Brzkd5CnjziSX_Wm-ASzLSOwoT_1wMUK-4A5oYGkSpLd2nlso93hzPYNog73Z9wENxb0W793JNmfbqwXmzaJwNOkjjzbJcC4IPj_-guE0rPG_zR7NtiSAL_63M\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj94fqHUnH9pDZHRMapEo43qs7yqCQMHVmRQOOYECAHsmLuRAOi1T3xygQfbpbjxVjz6Brzkd5CnjziSX_Wm-ASzLSOwoT_1wMUK-4A5oYGkSpLd2nlso93hzPYNog73Z9wENxb0W793JNmfbqwXmzaJwNOkjjzbJcC4IPj_-guE0rPG_zR7NtiSAL_63M\" width=\"240\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p>In every situation of life we must be stand at single idea to get success at any cost. Whether we will be unsuccessful, but we should never be negative for this. The challenge come before us to make us strong and powerful to fight. Never bow head before any situation because situation will be changed before your determination. God has given us divine power to fight with the all the difficulties in life, but we forgot our power and understand week ourselves. Our thought changes the environment and make it stress free and ideal for life. Nature is pure but by our thinking we make it stressful. It is not safe for development of ideal mind and soul. Our soul is pure and full of positive and benevolent ideas for the growth and development of human civilization of human beings. The idea of mind is flamed to achieve the goal in the world. It is just like a spark which burn everything when it converts into fire. Our thought must be strong so that it might not be changed in any circumstances. Our circumstance is very powerful it try to deviate us but if our soul is strong then we will always succeed in life.</p><p><br /></p><p>Thus it is clear that our thought is key point of our success and failure. So we should always be positive to live a happy life.</p>",
      "snippet": "If you change your mindset, you have the ability to change your whole world. The most important thing is our mindset because our thought is responsible for creation of our future. The idea of our mind is so much creative so that we should be successful at any cost. Our thought is...",
