      "title": "The Time Which Passed By.",
      "slug": "the-time-which-passed-by",
      "published": "2024-04-26T05:44:00.000-07:00",
      "dateFormatted": "April 26, 2024",
      "monthYear": "April 2024",
      "year": "2024",
      "author": "Prof. Sulekh Kumar",
      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "When the time of life is passing through a challenging situation it seems to very hard to control ourselves, but we try to do so because we can't do anything except that. The moment of life is very bad when some important person of life denies you to tell anything. Life should be such that no one can come and interrupt us. Life is a very small period, but some situation is very critical to understand. When we completely control our emotion, we become strict like stone. But if we think positive then we find that all event of our life is interconnected to each other and always try to show us a progressive path. The power of Supreme soul is eternal and mysterious which always seems like a miracle.<div>Never repent us for the past because it can't be returned, and future can't be changed so we should always live in present.</div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjh7tRM23mTSsXQ4rO8UBsEArIIHFrmBs177qYzUrWwGYNZMTRy7eALdhy60RHH3xo9VZn_uJmBcirtA7d9HPJ_SOXE1cLoQxY6RsIx4pXGrLSGhG-6GyZ3-yrlYDQPyCf9g5meGyjcEVB78z9tVTKfEPEONpGcqoKiwI8-UittJEZtRbLfkE2BLRRdQXw\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"239\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjh7tRM23mTSsXQ4rO8UBsEArIIHFrmBs177qYzUrWwGYNZMTRy7eALdhy60RHH3xo9VZn_uJmBcirtA7d9HPJ_SOXE1cLoQxY6RsIx4pXGrLSGhG-6GyZ3-yrlYDQPyCf9g5meGyjcEVB78z9tVTKfEPEONpGcqoKiwI8-UittJEZtRbLfkE2BLRRdQXw=w512-h239\" width=\"512\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">The present moment contains past and future. These proverbs tell us that if we make our present&nbsp;</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">better than our past and future will be the best. Because we are special in the world. We consist of some supreme power which may be defined as the divine power. God has given us loss of opportunity to succeed in the life, but we don't understand that and wander here and there in search of good life. We should always focus on our work and thing to learn. We should be more active to fight the coming event in the life. We are supreme power of God . I always say that our effort is more powerful. I always try to achieve the best of my life. In this condition our powerful part of life is determination. If we are going to reach the top of the world. We will have to face the more severe situation. Just like the sun we have to fight the problems and bad situation to make our reorganization. A step towards success is full of large number of problem but the man who is dedicated to his goal finally achieve it. There is no power in the storm to bow down the strong tree which is full of strength. Our faith on ourselves is strong power to achieve everything. So always be positive and work regularly to achieve the target.</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><br /></div><br /><br /></div>",
      "snippet": "When the time of life is passing through a challenging situation it seems to very hard to control ourselves, but we try to do so because we can't do anything except that. The moment of life is very bad when some important person of life denies you to tell anything. Life should be...",
