      "author": "Prof. Sulekh Kumar",
      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #cc0000; font-family: courier;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #cc0000; font-family: inherit;\">\"Every next level of your life will demand a different you.\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Life is not a fixed stage, it is gradually progressing stage which will always demand a different you. Our life growing and reaching to the apex of our ambition so each and every step must be better than the previous one. Our life wishes some different talent or skill by the time. Because each and every thing in the universe is dynamic. It is fact that Changing is the rule of nature. If we will not change ourselves by the time we will left behind in the process of growth and development.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>Our successive effort to reach to the goal must be full of enthusiasm&nbsp;</span><span>and zeal. Our thought must be sacred to achieve the supreme goal. Time gives&nbsp;us a opportunity to improve us by the time and try to achieve the goal. One of the most important things of life is that it never gives you second chance to improve you. So, we must try to do the best our life . Whether it is mystery but you must work on your thought because our thought can change everything of our life. We should not be burden on anyone. Perhaps our life is important for us and this creation but since we are wasting it for other so everyone understand us useless .</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">It is very challenging moment for us because We are losing our self-respect, so We are very sad. Self-Respect of a person is dignity of life so everyone must be preserve our self respect. While&nbsp; we think that our life demand us a different character at an instant we must improve us . Because this moment will be a turning point of life. When we&nbsp; see past event of our life then we find that all event are interconnected to each other to support us to achieve our goal.So We should never repent for anything which happen in our life. But we are human being so we can't forget passed event very easily. We should always be positive because God always save us from every unwanted event of life which don't meet our achievement. Every situation of life is a opportunity to learn and proceed further to achieve the best our life. Supreme power always save us from bad company and guide us to reach to target of our life.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Never think that you are always wrong ,because&nbsp; the price of diamond can only a Jewler&nbsp;understand.\" We are&nbsp; special but when we give more time to anyone they understand us useless. Time&nbsp;teaches us a new lesson of life. So it must&nbsp; remember that time is the best teacher.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">The progressive approach&nbsp;of life is more exciting and impressive because it provide us a situation to improve ourselves. Finally it is clear that ever step of your life will demand a different you.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #cc0000; font-family: courier;\"><br /></span></p>",
      "snippet": "&nbsp; \"Every next level of your life will demand a different you.\" Life is not a fixed stage, it is gradually progressing stage which will always demand a different you. Our life growing and reaching to the apex of our ambition so each and every step must be better than the prev...",
