      "contentHtml": "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ffa400; font-family: georgia;\">\"You have to fight through some bad days to earn the best days of your life.\"</span></b></h3><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">This proverb</span><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">&nbsp;tells that your future will only be better when you will work&nbsp;hard today to make the change. Our every effort is precious because success will not result due to only last&nbsp;effort,&nbsp;but every effort broken the obstacle of life. So,&nbsp;it is clear that we don't ignore our effort,&nbsp;we should only be consistent&nbsp;in our work and finally it will reach us to our target. Every bad day irrigates us with bitter taste of life and make us strong and powerful to face the best day of our lives.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Each and every moment of life is an&nbsp;exam because it always teaches us a new lesson of life.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: red;\">\"If you were born poor it is not your mistake but if you die in poverty,&nbsp;it is your mistake.\"</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Life is yours so live it in your&nbsp;own way and always try to make your tomorrow better than today. It is&nbsp;the process of life everything will be better if you will be always positive. Our positive energy</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">change the flow of the energy of the nature and our life become better.&nbsp;&nbsp;Everything is result of our thinking whether it is bad days or it is our good days. We should always fight our bad days because&nbsp;changing is the rule of nature.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Everything that you deserve by your talent is your&nbsp;reward. Never try to get something free because it will make us unskilled.&nbsp;Practice makes&nbsp;us perfect so whenever we get time,&nbsp;we must practice our different&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">skill.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Our future is result of our today work if we do&nbsp;better today,&nbsp;we will achieve the best&nbsp;tomorrow.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Thus,&nbsp;it&nbsp;is clear that our bads day change into good days only our effort and positive view of life.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br /></span></div>",
      "snippet": "\"You have to fight through some bad days to earn the best days of your life.\" This proverb &nbsp;tells that your future will only be better when you will work&nbsp;hard today to make the change. Our every effort is precious because success will not result due to only last&nbsp;ef...",
