      "year": "2023",
      "author": "Prof. Sulekh Kumar",
      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;\"Where there is will, there is way.\" This proverb talks about our determination. If we think to do something, we can do. There is no limitation of any one thought. Everything is possible in this world.</p><p>If we work hard to achieve our goal, we can achieve it. Because Every plan first appears in mind thereafter it become true. If our effort is honest and focused, then we can convert impossible into possible. Human is masterpiece of God, so we are capable to do every work which come in our mind. There must be consistency or regularity in our effort. When we start any work, it grows from zero and it takes a lot of time to accomplish. It is only patience which bind us with our goal. Distraction is natural phenomenon so it is clear that we may deviate from our goal but if we keep patience then we reached to our destination successfully. Our Each effort is precious to proceeds towards our goal.&nbsp;</p><p>We must think that our life is limited so we must do all work so fast so that we may complete our important work within our life span. If we are determined to achieve something, no one can defeat us . Our thought is our life which appears true in future. We must sustain patience because every great work takes lot of time to accomplish. We must think big, fast and ahead so that it will be better than today.&nbsp;</p><p>Everyone is special in this world so never think that I am useless. God never create anything in vain. We all are power of God or Nature. So, we don't discriminate among each other. We must contribute to development of our nation and our people. We will go away from earth one day, but our thoughts and works will be remembered till the end of earth. So be good and do good. We must help other if we are capable to do, because we are in list of givers.</p><p>Finally, I conclude that where there is will, there is way. We are capable to achieve everything by our effort and dedication.&nbsp;</p>",
      "snippet": "&nbsp;\"Where there is will, there is way.\" This proverb talks about our determination. If we think to do something, we can do. There is no limitation of any one thought. Everything is possible in this world. If we work hard to achieve our goal, we can achieve it. Because Every pl...",
