      "title": "Work is worship.",
      "slug": "work-is-worship",
      "published": "2023-05-07T06:11:00.001-07:00",
      "dateFormatted": "May 07, 2023",
      "monthYear": "May 2023",
      "year": "2023",
      "author": "Prof. Sulekh Kumar",
      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: red;\">\"<b><u>Work is worship</u></b></span>\". This proverb talks about the importance of work in life. We must do our work with full dedication because our works reflect us. Everyone makes his recognition by his work. We will be remembered for our work so we must do good work for society and our country. If we contribute to the development of our nation, then our life will be useful otherwise it will be useless. We are created for the participation in the working of nature. So, we must survive for welfare of nature. We are inseparable part of nature, so our contribution plays major role. Everyone is special so we must recognize our quality which is gifted to us by nature and use it for implementation of nature project.</p><p>Human is masterpiece created by nature. Human is full intellect and emotion. We have power to control ourselves and other. But sometimes we do not control our extreme desire and it will provide us harmful impact. Our desire must be harmonical and guided by our soul. It must be positive and fruitful us and nature.</p><p>We must protect our self-esteem because it teaches us to live with dignity and glory. We are born free, live free and die free. We are above all the bond of the physical world. We are capable to do each work with perfectness, but we do not give our full efficiency.</p><p>Finally, I conclude that our work reflect our image and it is our worship which must accomplish on time with full efficiency.</p>",
