      "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;\"<span style=\"color: red;\">Labour never go in vain</span>.\" This proverb talks about the importance of labor. Our effort never go vain i.e., it returns us something. So, we must try to do something every moment. \"An idle mind is devil workshop.\" Hence, we must keep our mind busy in any work so that our mind can remains active. Every day we rise with endless energy, but we don't use it we waste it in vain. So you must use your energy in the welfare of creation and its creature. You must remind yourself that your life span is limited so you to do all essential work in this limited time. Human is extreme source of energy and power, but we understand ourselves helpless. We try to fight with difficulties coming in life because it provides us patience and courage to win.</p><p>Challenges empower us to proceeds further and achieve our goals. But we become afraid of challenge and bow our head. It is not good we must accept challenge and try to find the best solution.&nbsp;</p><p>I finally concluded that we must be active ,creative and imaginative for our life and future.</p><p>Thank you!</p>",
