      "authorTitle": "Qualified UGC NET DEC-2024 & 2025 for Assistant Professor & Admission to Ph.D. in Computer Science & Application",
      "contentHtml": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><u><span style=\"color: red; font-family: times;\"><b>&nbsp;\"The man is not a slave of his circumstances ,but he is slave of his soul.\"</b></span></u></h1><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\">Man is free from every boundation of the world but he always understands&nbsp;that he is completely dependent&nbsp;on others. He lives in a miracle that he is controlled by his circumstances not by his soul. But it is not truth, truth is that he is only grateful to his soul . Each and everything in the world is made for your soul not for your body so always try to do every work with 100% efficiency to get desired results. If you are thinking a lots without doing anything it not good for you. You should always try to work hard to achieve success and a better place in the world. The world is made for us but we always think that we are apart from it. We have to born here to participate in the process of God, but we underestimate these things and always think about ourselves. If we have educated,&nbsp;then we must teach all illiterate for their better life and assist in process of running the creation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\">&nbsp; \"Labour never go in vain.\" According to this proverbs it is clear that our each effort give us something in return so we must try to anything every time. Our every effort play a major role in our achievement. Don't think about outer world, always think about inner world and try to do best it will return you the best. Don't waste your time use it for your own life and rise above your access. Always think high and work differently with enthusiasm. Always be positive to reach a goal because negative energy divert you and deviate you from your goal. Believe on yourself&nbsp; to proceed further because you have to walk on your way alone without any support. Be self dependent to make your recognition in&nbsp;the world.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Experience from good and bad path will always guide you to succeed in life. Our failures are the best teacher for me. It resists us to go on that way.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">I finally conclude that everyone is free from the bond of physical world we are power of nature so must work without any exhaustion. We are source of extreme energy and unlimited thoughts which is bearing in our imaginary mind. Humans are intellectual creature of the universe consisting of endless thoughts. These thoughts will remain till the end of the earth. So we must create new thoughts for welfare of the universe and human beings.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Thank you !</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></p>",
